  "Windows Hello": "Windows Hello",
  "PIN / biometrics": "PIN / 生体認証",
  "strong": "強力",
  "Windows Hello confirms it is you before unlocking.": "ロック解除前に Windows Hello で本人確認します。",
  "asks every launch": "起動ごとに確認",
  "AES-256-GCM with a key derived from your password; asked each launch.": "パスワードから導出した鍵を使う AES-256-GCM。起動ごとに入力が必要です。",
  "Do not remember": "記憶しない",
  "nothing on disk": "ディスクに保存しない",
